.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Runtime working state (campaign driver state, session notes). Never committed.
claude_docs/

# Reserved-prefix workflow artifacts (review results, consult payloads). Never committed.
.rawgentic-*

# index/index.html is a BUILD ARTIFACT, derived from `vercel project ls` by
# index/build_index.py. Committing it would recreate the shared mutable file
# whose lost-row race motivated deriving it (owner decision 2026-08-01).
# Rebuild it; never edit or commit it.
index/index.html

# Local virtualenv. Untracked and previously not ignored, so it showed in every
# `git status` and was one blanket `git add` away from being committed (#34, finding S6).
.venv/

# Local doc-harness state when the service is run OUTSIDE Docker. In the container these
# live on named volumes; on a developer machine they land here and are never committed.
/var-doc-harness/
harness-local-cache/
harness-local-registry.db*

# The deploy secrets. `docker compose` reads this file automatically from the project
# directory, which is the whole point: before it existed the two tokens lived ONLY inside
# the running container, and a restart could not be reproduced by anyone who had not typed
# them in the first place. Ignored rather than merely absent, because a blanket `git add`
# is exactly how a token reaches a public repository. `.env.example` is tracked and holds
# names only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Scratch from the mandatory post-deploy browser smoketest. The tool writes snapshots and
# console logs here on every run; the screenshots it is asked to keep go to docs/smoke/.
.playwright-cli/
